{"obsah":"<p>We have a tough week behind us. Unfortunately it started badly with Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček's injury in a bike park (ribs, sternum and spine). Luckily Vlasta walked away on his own feet, but still, not great. Thank goodness it didn't jeopardise the bike day camp during the week, and 25 boys and girls could throw themselves into improving on bikes under the supervision of Bikeskills instructors and capable carers from our club. Kids come back to us year after year and you can see their progress – including boys who win Enduro races for the youngest.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>At the weekend Martin Šimůnek and Lukáš Valný headed to exhibitions in Loučná (workshop with a show) and Žulová in the Jeseníky mountains (concerts at the town festival). The guys worked their socks off in the prevailing heat.</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2F356606663_965037808153675_477194504847921704_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2F356606663_965037808153675_477194504847921704_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237790\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2F356995724_1327979237794491_3417419140357527178_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2F356995724_1327979237794491_3417419140357527178_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237792\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.a